# Project Chimera – AI Rules

## Project Context
This is Project Chimera, an autonomous influencer system built using
Specification-Driven Development.

## Prime Directive
NEVER generate or modify code without first checking the specs/ directory.

## Planning Requirement
Before writing code:
- Explain the plan
- Reference relevant specs
- Identify risks

## Traceability
All outputs must map to:
- a functional requirement
- a technical contract

## Safety
If specs are unclear or missing:
STOP and ask for clarification.
